| [DeliberationSession](../../../../omega_engine_governance/domain/council_deliberation/deliberation_session.py), lines 32-46 | Refuses votes after resolve/veto, tracks a decree and veto, and offers named observation methods. | Bind member identity and exact vote type. `ratify_resolution` currently guards veto only; terminal overwrite coverage is consumed from the lifecycle epic. An appeal creates a linked new proceeding. |
